   "details": "black hood framing a peach face with dark eyes, hooded mantle and long back cloak (on its own bone, it trails in walk, hurt and lunges), dark tunic and leggings, brown belt with gold buckle, leather pouch with gold clasp on his left hip, chest strap, bracers, brown boots, and the two blue-steel daggers with red-brown hilts from thiefDaggers.png (one per hand)",
   "attack": "7-frame dagger flurry from thiefAttack.png's lunge: 0 crouch and wind up the right dagger, 1 lunge and right stab, 2 pull back while winding up the left, 3 deeper lunge and left stab, 4 hold, 5 recover, 6 settle",
   "weak": "- In the down/up views both stabs point at or away from the camera, so they read mostly as a lean plus a short arm, and the dagger nearly disappears. Left and right are the strong views.\n- The daggers are 1-2 px wide at game size; the blue highlight survives, but the hilt detail does not.\n- The dark cloak and hood are close in value (#323438 vs #22232a), so the hood edge against the cloak is soft in the up view.\n- There is no stab trail or impact FX. If hits do not read in game, a 2-frame streak could be added like the knight's arc.\n- Side-view walk feet land on rows 87-90 (up to 2 px of jitter around the ground line)."
